          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For storm cleanup and occasional cutting in a suburb, the EGO CS1800 is the best battery saw for most owners, with the Ryobi 40V 14-inch for lighter work. For firewood, the Stihl MS 271 Farm Boss and Husqvarna 450 Rancher are the proven mid-size gas choices, and the Echo CS-590 suits those who cut big hardwood.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
